NAME
  vtkSHYXPartitionedCollectionToOpenFOAM
DESCRIPTION
  "Write an OpenFOAM case (constant/polyMesh) from an IOSS-style vtkPartitionedDataSetCollection with a volume block and side sets."
GROUPS
  Vascular
DEPENDS
  VTK::CommonCore
  VTK::CommonDataModel
  VTK::CommonExecutionModel
  VTK::FiltersCore
PRIVATE_DEPENDS
  VTK::IOGeometry
